  "content": "<p>熟食模組新增了多種原版風格的食物熟食版本，包含烤蘋果、烤甜菜根、烤胡蘿蔔與烤雞蛋。可透過熔爐、煙燻爐或營火烹調這些食材。無論單人遊玩或多人連線都十分適合，完美融入原版強化包、大雜燴整合包、專家模式包等各類模組包！</p><p>靈感源自舊版《Minecraft》中<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-progressions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tiny Progressions</a>模組的烤蘋果設計並進一步擴充。</p><p>建議安裝配方檢視模組（如JEI、REI或EMI）以查看合成配方。</p><p>本模組可無縫兼容其他熱門Minecraft模組，支援Minecraft Forge 1.20.1與NeoForge 1.21.1。目前暫不考慮移植至其他模組載入器或回溯至舊版本。</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmuggleorwizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1316906/description_212e8b08-5443-4c81-964a-b69de38495d9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"830\" height=\"256\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MuggleOrWizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1316906/description_cbff7ec1-1f1b-409c-9c1a-223181ac7780.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"578\" height=\"192\"></a></p><hr><p>歡迎將本模組用於模組包中。未經許可請勿於CurseForge以外平台散佈。</p><p>歡迎留言提供反饋、疑問、建議或錯誤回報。感謝您的下載！</p><p>官方Discord伺服器：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.com/invite/GhwnpFeWKH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/GhwnpFeWKH</a></p>",
